WEBVTT

00:32:55.246 --> 00:33:00.204
What you're highlighting here is that if
you had plunged more of your time,

00:33:00.204 --> 00:33:03.079
energy and resources into foghorn,

00:33:03.246 --> 00:33:05.579
you might have missed out on
a much bigger possibility.

00:33:05.954 --> 00:33:11.413
Yes, I absolutely agree. I mean, it's
like maybe this is a bad analogy,

00:33:12.454 --> 00:33:15.871
but it's like the friend who's dating

00:33:15.871 --> 00:33:20.496
the person that everyone kind of
knows isn't the right match.

00:33:20.496 --> 00:33:22.371
And even the friend isn't very happy.

00:33:22.829 --> 00:33:26.788
But they're worried that if they
break up with that person,

00:33:26.788 --> 00:33:31.413
there won't be any other person for them.
That is the exact same phenomenon.